     A* SCRIPTURA DATA WORK FILE FOR POLICY PAGES - LOCATIONS/NAMED   *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A*  PROJECT:  SY371        PROGRAMMER:  C:65                     *
     A*  CREATED:  02/22/16                                           *
     A*  DESCRIPTION:  THIS IS THE WORK FILE TO HOLD THE DATA FOR     *
     A*                POLICY PAGE SCHEDULE OF OPERATIONS - LOCATIONS *
     A*                AND NAMED INSURED.                             *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                TYPES OF LINE ITEMS:                           *
     A*                'A' - ADDITIONAL NAMED INSURED DATA.           *
     A*                'L' - LOCATION/OTHER WORKPLACE DATA.           *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 06/23/23 C:65  Project: 153WAH                                *
     A*                ADD FIELDS FOR PHONE # AND FAX #.              *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 06/09/21 C:65  Project: 148WCR                                *
     A*                ADD FIELDS FOR LOC/ENT AND TYPE OF BUSINESS.   *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 02/08/18 C:65  Project: 148WAT                                *
     A*                ADD NAME LINK CODE FIELD FOR DBA NAME.         *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 11/22/17 C:65  Project: 150WAO                                *
     A*                ADD NEW FIELD FOR EMPLOYER LINK CODE (PEO).    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 11/08/17 C:65  Project: 148WAN                                *
     A*                ADD NEW FIELDS FOR NAME LINK ENTITY, NAME      *
     A*                LINK COUNTER, AND # OF EMPLOYEES.  ADD SEQ#    *
     A*                FOR ADDITIONAL NAMED INSURED.                  *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 06/20/16 C:65  PROJECT: SY371                                 *
     A*                CHANGE DATE FIELDS TO BE 8.0S INSTEAD OF       *
     A*                FORMATTED FIELDS. CHANGE CITY/STATE/ZIP TO BE  *
     A*                SEPARATE FIELDS.                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PP201                     TEXT('POL PG LOC/NAME WORKFILE')
     A*
     A* KEY FIELDS
     A*
     A            P2XML         60A         COLHDG('XML FILE NAME')
     A*
     A            P2KEY          9S 0
     A                                      COLHDG('INCREMENTING' 'KEY')
     A*
     A            P2TYPE    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('TYPE OF LINE ITEM')
     A*
     A            P2ADDNAM     120A
     A                                      COLHDG('ADDL NAMED INS NAME')
     A*
     A            P2LOCNAME    120A
     A                                      COLHDG('LOCATION NAME (DBA)')
     A            P2LOCFDNM    120A
     A                                      COLHDG('LOCATION FED NAME')
     A*
     A            P2FEIN         9A
     A                                      COLHDG('FEIN #')
     A*
     A*** BEGIN CHG ***  06/20/16  ********************************************
     A*****       P2EFFDATE R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A*****                                 COLHDG('EFFECTIVE DATE')
     A*****       P2EXPDATE R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A*****                                 COLHDG('EXPIRATION DATE')
     A            P2EFFDATE      8S 0
     A                                      COLHDG('EFFECTIVE DATE')
     A            P2EXPDATE      8S 0
     A                                      COLHDG('EXPIRATION DATE')
     A*** END CHG *****  06/20/16  ********************************************
     A*
     A            P2PHYSAD1 R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('PHYSICAL ADDRESS 1')
     A            P2PHYSAD2 R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('PHYSICAL ADDRESS 2')
     A            P2PHYSCSZ R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('PHYSICAL CITY/ST/ZIP')
