     A            P2PHYSST  R               REFFLD(ST)
     A                                      COLHDG('PHYSICAL' 'STATE')
     A            P2PHYSZIP R     S         REFFLD(ZIP)
     A                                      COLHDG('PHYSICAL' 'ZIP CODE')
     A*** END ADD *****  06/20/16  ********************************************
     A*
     A            P2MAILAD1 R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAILING ADDRESS 1')
     A            P2MAILAD2 R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAILING ADDRESS 2')
